{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつきっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/01/5466446/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズアワードに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ出演してきましたっ(*/ω＼*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったぁーっ！女の子向けのイベントだったけど来てくれてた人いるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりファッションイベントは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洒落なお客さんばっかり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーも何人かファッションショーにも出演してたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若は稽古があったので出番のあと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐ出ちゃったんだけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もいつか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ランウェイ歩いてみたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも1つの目標に掲げてたから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、転びそうだけど。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洒落好きだし、もっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子力あげて、頑張らないとだねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズアワードありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ちゃんの代わりにさゆにゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/01/IMG_5470.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりたんにぎゅーされた(*/ω＼*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/01/5466446/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しい。難し過ぎる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつまで経っても出ないだろう答えを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は今も探し続けている。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その答えが出た時が、時なのだと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思える日だと信じて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考える。進めているのかと不安になる日もある。でも【いつか】という言葉にかけてみる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまり、もっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未知なる魅力に溢れた人間になりたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1で語れる人にならないでいたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、努力します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に 作品作ったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/01/5466446/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感じるものはそれぞれで(*ﾟｰﾟ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深くは解説しません。足は私の足！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ちゃんは舞台稽古で...明日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台初日を迎えますね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日頑張って稽古して、学校との両立大変だったよね。本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ちゃんおめでとう(∗ˊ꒳ˋ∗)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日頑張ってね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若も頑張るっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃお！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/01/5466446/0004.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}